HeroDeathResurrect AI Hero Reviver Loop
    Events
    Conditions
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in HeroDeathResurrect_TempGroup and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit is alive) Equal to True
                        (HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit has an item of type Spirit Shard) Equal to True
                    Then - Actions
                        -------- Search for Deceased units nearby --------
                        Set VariableSet HeroDeathResurrect_TempPoint = (Position of HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit)
                        Set VariableSet HeroDeathResurrect_DeadGroup = (Units within 1200.00 of HeroDeathResurrect_TempPoint matching ((Unit-type of (Matching unit)) Equal to Deceased).)
                        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                            If - Conditions
                                (Number of units in HeroDeathResurrect_DeadGroup) Greater than 0
                            Then - Actions
                                Set VariableSet HeroDeathResurrect_DeadUnit = (Random unit from HeroDeathResurrect_DeadGroup)
                                Unit - Order HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit to Stop.
                                Unit - Order HeroDeathResurrect_HeroUnit to Human Mountain King - Storm Bolt HeroDeathResurrect_DeadUnit
                            Else - Actions
                        -------- Clean --------
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_HeroDeathResurrect_TempPoint)
                        Unit Group - Remove all units from HeroDeathResurrect_DeadGroup.
                        Unit Group - Remove all units from HeroDeathResurrect_TempGroup.
                    Else - Actions
